 "head": {
  "text": "WF-030 Hard synchronization on the SOF edge from bus idle"
 },
 "foot": {
  "text": "Before SOF the free-running counter has an arbitrary phase. The recessive to dominant edge of SOF during bus idle restarts the bit time: the clock of the edge becomes SYNC_SEG and the counter continues from tq 1 (REF-002 synchronization rule 3)."
 }
